msgid "This menu contains general commands for working with Draw documents, such as create, open, close and print. To close $[officename] Draw, click <emph>Exit</emph>."
msgstr "Este menú contiene órdenes generales para trabajar con documentos de Draw, como crear, abrir, cerrar e imprimir. Para cerrar $[officename] Draw, pulse en <emph>Salir</emph>."

