"help.text"
msgid "Resolve / Unresolve"
msgstr "Resuelto / Sin resolver"

#. M6x5n
#: comment_menu.xhp
msgctxt ""
"comment_menu.xhp\n"
"par_id751685993265436\n"
"help.text"
msgid "Marks the comment as <emph>Resolved</emph> (or <emph>Unresolved</emph>). When you mark the comment resolved, the word <emph>Resolved</emph> is inserted under the date in the comment box. When marking unresolved, the word <emph>Resolved</emph> is removed."
msgstr "Marca el comentario como <emph>Resuelto</emph> (o <emph>Sin resolver</emph>). Cuando marca el comentario resuelto, la palabra <emph>Resuelto</emph> se inserta debajo de la fecha en el cuadro de comentarios. Al marcar como no resuelto, se elimina la palabra <emph>Resuelto</emph>."

#. EfGUV
#: comment_menu.xhp
msgctxt ""
"comment_menu.xhp\n"
"hd_id541685982812304\n"
"help.text"
